OL,3,GNEWSAKnife crime hospital admissions
OL,4,Afall across county
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital admissions linked to knife
OL,7,Fcrime have fallen significantly in a
OL,8,Fcounty over the past six years,
OL,9,Faccording to a new report.
OL,11,FThe report by the office of
OL,12,FCambridgeshire's police and crime
OL,13,Fcommissioner Darryl Preston said
OL,14,Fadmissions after assaults involving a
OL,15,Fsharp object had reduced by almost half
OL,16,Fsince the year ending March 2020.
OL,18,FDespite a longer-term decline, the
OL,19,Freport said both accounts of knife
OL,20,Fcrime and related hospital admissions
OL,21,Fhad risen in the past year.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
